Package: reflowR
Title: Themed Extensions for 'workflowr' Research Workflows
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Extends the 'workflowr' package with themed colour schemes,
    structured analysis pipeline templates and utility scripts for
    reproducible research. Wraps wflow_start() from 'workflowr' and adds the
    nine topic families of the Computational Trauma and Tissue Injury
    Research (CTTIR) v5 design language as site schemes (Okabe-Ito accents,
    light and dark surfaces, Inter and JetBrains Mono typography from shared
    design tokens), three depth presets for the R Markdown pipeline (minimal,
    standard, extended), CSS/SCSS theming, SVG family icons, 'ggplot2' theme
    functions and a 'Quarto' report template. All generated projects remain
    fully compatible with standard 'workflowr' commands. Further interfaces
    run file-producing analysis steps and imaging workflows of installed
    package functions as fingerprinted, resumable pipelines with verified
    receipts, and scaffold and validate strict project profiles.
